A||||105||Turbo88||Fiero POWER_FEST!!!!!!!!!||||1||
Z||000000||Turbo88||09-18-2001||11:58 PM||||After some discussion in various threads through out the board, (mostly V8 vs turbo V6), we have decided the best way to settle it is to have an event! So here it is.. We are looking at having the first annual (?) Fiero Power Fest next spring. There will be 'show', but this show is all about the 'go'!<BR>Archie has already agreed to bring "several V8 cars" and have even challenged people running his kit to winner take all 500 dollar match. I am going to match that with a 500 dollar challenge to anyone running my turbo kit (available in October). <P>So there you have it! The fastest Fiero's in the land will be there competing for honor, glory and 500 bucks (each class). And, if there is enough interest, and if I can raise the sponsers, I am going to put together a "fastest fiero in the land" winner take all prize package (trophey and enough beer(coca-cola?) money to cover the weekend)! I am planning on a weekend event with drag racing and SCCA solo II style racing. That of course is depending on what the local strip and the SCCA region are willing to do. So those of you that want in on the action, post here, let us know. <P>Most importantly, we have severaly other Fiero related events through out the spring and we do not want to interfer with those. So please post the dates of other known national and large regional events. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroMaster88||09-19-2001||12:05 AM||||Let me know when and where!!  I will be there.  Sounds like fun, and a good place to check out all my work I am gonna do over the winter!<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
Z||000002||c m west||09-19-2001||12:07 AM||||At this point, count on Fieros West being there||||reg||1
Z||000003||LT1 Chop Top||09-19-2001||12:08 AM||||Where, when??<P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Cheever3000||09-19-2001||12:14 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Turbo88:<BR><B>...other Fiero related events through out the spring and we do not want to interfer with those. So please post the dates of other known national and large regional events. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Show season starts with Daytona which will probably be March 22-24.  Carolina Fieros at Rockingham will likely be around April 6.  Ed Parks might have another swap meet April 19th.  Archie might have another open house April 20th.  Fieros at Carlisle <I>and</I> the 10th OKC FieroFest probably May 18.  Memorial Day I believe is May 27, with the Dells Run the following weekend.  I started to keep typing, but the rest is after Spring anyway.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Turbo88||09-19-2001||12:16 AM||||The event is currently scheduled to run in St Louis, MO next spring. Exact dates are dependant on other major Fiero related events around the nation. It is getting late in the year for what surely will be a major event. <P>I need to know the dates that major events are occuring so I can coordinate with the tracks and personal and get costs and build ups...<P>||||reg||1
