Z||000015||Joe Torma||09-19-2001||01:38 AM||||You better include everyone!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif"> Turbo V6's aren't the only 6's that make some power.<P>The classes are definetly going to have to be worked out though!<P>I see the turbo crew and v8s have $$$ for the winners.  Kinda sucks for us naturally asperated 6cyl guys...but whatever...this started as a match between you guys.  <P>I say a drag and autocross both are necessary--maybe different days.  I pretty much agree with what Archie says about classes.<P>Run all the V8s, Turbo6, 3800, 3800SC, 3.4, 2.8/3.1, 4cyl seperately.  Pick top winner from each class and pit each winner against eachother for final drag.<P>This will be fun.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig1.gif">    <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR> <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 09-19-2001).]||||reg||1
