Z||000021||Hartz||09-19-2001||09:58 AM||||I posted this on one of the other threads, before realizing this thread was now the discussion point for this event.  Anyway, does anybody remember the old series from Car Craft - Real Street Eliminator? I don't have the details in front of me, but I remember they had a drag strip competition, an autocross, a drivability/milage event, and they factored in cost to build, and a subjective quality/looks judgement. <P>Run whatcha brung - Quad4, 3.1 Turbo, 3400, 3800, SBC, Northstar - whatever!<P>We could solve a LOT of forum arguments with an event like this!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo<BR>||||reg||1
