Z||000029||Jefrysuko||09-19-2001||03:49 PM||||Sounds like a great idea to me.  I would love to put a few passes down the dragstrip on my SE.  I don't really care about classes.  I would be going for a good time and not to win anything.  I do have one suggestion though.  Why not run bracket racing for anyone who wants to join in and then have a separate event for the Turbo V6 / V8.<P>For those of you that don't know about bracket racing it is designed so that winning is based on driver skill only and not the speed of your car.  Most of the time though you still divide the individual brackets up based on times.<P>Just a thought to throw in with the rest of them.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Jefrysuko (edited 09-19-2001).]||||reg||1
