Z||000031||sluppy123||09-19-2001||05:48 PM||||I'm there as long as it's no more than a 1000 miles from me. I'll have my intercooler installed by the end of winter, so I'll be running full boost.<P>I like Slammed's Idea of different classes, then have the winners from each class compete against each other. Having drag and autocross event's would keep it fair and competitive.<P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>87' GT-Galaxy silver mettalic, Turbo Charged, Modified 2.8- 235 HP w/ 7 psi Boost, Eibach Sport springs, RSM side scoops, Mr Mikes leather, 17" Mille Miglia's. <BR>               <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1711832&a=12781563&p=48213929&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
